sequenceDiagram
    participant PlatOp as ODH Platform Operator
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant ModOp as feast-module-operator<br/>controller-runtime
    participant FS as Local Filesystem<br/>/opt/manifests
    participant Prom as Prometheus

    Note over PlatOp,ModOp: Flow 1: FeastOperator CR Reconciliation

    PlatOp->>K8sAPI: Create FeastOperator CR<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount Token
    K8sAPI-->>ModOp: Watch event: FeastOperator CR<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount Token

    Note over ModOp: Reconciliation Pipeline:<br/>initialize → upgradeIfNeeded →<br/>setKustomizedParams → releases →<br/>reconcilePlatformVersion → kustomize →<br/>migrateDeploymentSelector → deploy → status → gc

    ModOp->>FS: Read kustomize manifests<br/>(from init container emptyDir)
    FS-->>ModOp: Rendered manifests<br/>(ODH or RHOAI overlay)
    ModOp->>K8sAPI: Apply rendered resources<br/>(Deployment, RBAC, CRDs, Services)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount Token
    K8sAPI-->>ModOp: Resource creation confirmed
    ModOp->>K8sAPI: Update FeastOperator status<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount Token

    Note over PlatOp,ModOp: Flow 2: Platform Version Handshake

    PlatOp->>K8sAPI: Write platformVersion to<br/>odh-feastoperator-config ConfigMap<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount Token
    K8sAPI-->>ModOp: Watch event: ConfigMap update<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount Token
    ModOp->>ModOp: Run version-gated migrations<br/>(currently stubs)
    ModOp->>K8sAPI: Update FeastOperator<br/>status.releases[platform]<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount Token

    Note over Prom,ModOp: Metrics Collection

    Prom->>ModOp: GET /metrics<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS TLS<br/>Auth: Bearer Token (SA)
    ModOp-->>Prom: Prometheus metrics
